@startuml 05-rbac-retrieval
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title ACL aware retrieval, the RBAC highlight

actor User as u
participant "Identity\nours or external OIDC" as id
participant "Query plane" as q
participant "Vector index\nQdrant" as vec
participant "Authz engine\nours or external FGA" as authz
participant "Reranker" as rr
participant "LLM\nOpenRouter" as llm

u -> id : sign in
id --> q : subject, groups, tenant
u -> q : question
q -> vec : pre-filter by tenant and groups, overfetch top K times 3 to 5
vec --> q : candidate chunks
q -> authz : bulk check each candidate doc
authz --> q : allowed subset only
q -> rr : rerank allowed chunks
rr --> q : top chunks
q -> llm : answer from allowed context only
llm --> u : answer with citations to sources the user can open

note over q, authz
Pre-filter gives recall and speed. The authz post-check is the
source of truth and closes the leak that metadata alone cannot.
end note
@enduml
